  "content": {
    "id": "feedback-quadratic-checks-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "",
    "prompt": "Solve each equation and verify your solutions in the original equation.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "feedback-quadratic-checks-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\log_2(x-1)+\\log_2(x-3)=3$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=5$; reject $x=-1$ because both arguments are negative.\n\nCombine logs, solve the quadratic and check the original arguments.",
          "worked": "Domain: $x>3$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_2((x-1)(x-3)) &= 3 \\\\ (x-1)(x-3) &= 8 \\\\ x^2-4x-5 &= 0 \\\\ (x-5)(x+1) &= 0 \\\\ x &= 5\\text{ or }-1\\end{align*}$$\nFor $x=5$, $\\log_2 4+\\log_2 2=2+1=3$. For $x=-1$, the arguments are $-2$ and $-4$, so reject it. Hence $x=5$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 65
      },
      {
        "id": "feedback-quadratic-checks-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\log_3(x+1)+\\log_3(x-1)=1$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=2$; reject $x=-2$ because both arguments are negative.",
          "worked": "Domain: $x>1$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_3((x+1)(x-1)) &= 1 \\\\ (x+1)(x-1) &= 3 \\\\ x^2-4 &= 0 \\\\ (x-2)(x+2) &= 0 \\\\ x &= 2\\text{ or }-2\\end{align*}$$\nFor $x=2$, $\\log_3 3+\\log_3 1=1+0=1$. For $x=-2$, the arguments are $-1$ and $-3$, so reject it. Hence $x=2$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 65
      },
      {
        "id": "feedback-quadratic-checks-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$2\\log_2(x-4)-\\log_2(x-1)=2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=10$. The quadratic gives $x=2$ or $10$; reject $2$ because $x-4=-2$.\n\nApply the power and quotient laws, solve the quadratic, then check the original logarithm arguments.",
          "worked": "Domain: $x-4>0$ and $x-1>0$, so $x>4$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_2((x-4)^2)-\\log_2(x-1) &= 2 \\\\ \\log_2\\left(\\frac{(x-4)^2}{x-1}\\right) &= 2 \\\\ (x-4)^2 &= 4(x-1) \\\\ x^2-8x+16 &= 4x-4 \\\\ x^2-12x+20 &= 0 \\\\ (x-2)(x-10) &= 0 \\\\ x &= 2\\text{ or }10\\end{align*}$$\nBoth candidates are positive, but at $x=2$ the argument $x-4=-2$ is negative, so reject $2$.\nFor $x=10$:\n$$\\begin{align*}2\\log_2 6-\\log_2 9 &= \\log_2\\left(\\frac{36}{9}\\right) \\\\ &= \\log_2 4 \\\\ &= 2\\end{align*}$$\nHence $x=10$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 75
      },
      {
        "id": "feedback-quadratic-checks-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$\\log_2(x-1)-\\log_4(x+3)=1$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=3+2\\sqrt5$. Reject $3-2\\sqrt5$ because $x-1=2-2\\sqrt5<0$.\n\nChange to base 2, combine logs and solve the quadratic.",
          "worked": "Domain: $x-1>0$ and $x+3>0$, so $x>1$. Change to base 2:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_2(x-1)-\\frac12\\log_2(x+3) &= 1 \\\\ 2\\log_2(x-1)-\\log_2(x+3) &= 2 \\\\ \\log_2\\left(\\frac{(x-1)^2}{x+3}\\right) &= 2 \\\\ (x-1)^2 &= 4(x+3) \\\\ x^2-2x+1 &= 4x+12 \\\\ x^2-6x-11 &= 0 \\\\ x &= \\frac{6\\pm\\sqrt{36+44}}{2} \\\\ x &= 3\\pm2\\sqrt5\\end{align*}$$\nReject $x=3-2\\sqrt5$: the argument $x-1=2-2\\sqrt5$ is negative.\nFor $x=3+2\\sqrt5$, $x-1=2(1+\\sqrt5)$ and $x+3=(1+\\sqrt5)^2$. Substituting into the original equation:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_2(2(1+\\sqrt5))-\\log_4((1+\\sqrt5)^2) &= 1+\\log_2(1+\\sqrt5)-\\log_2(1+\\sqrt5) \\\\ &= 1\\end{align*}$$\nHence $x=3+2\\sqrt5$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 75
      }
    ]
  },
